or not. And so you know whether that's

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:51.040
the challenge. And so it's interesting to think

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:53.800
about. Certainly younger people acquire

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:58.600
motor skills much faster. We all know that, but I'm

